3. GENERATE EXPERIMENTAL STATIC CANDIDATE FEATURES
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Input Hough lines:

    experimental_data/experimental_data_hough_lines/

Run:

    python3 scripts/collect_static_candidate_features.py \
      --linesdir experimental_data/experimental_data_hough_lines \
      --outdir experimental_data/experimental_collected_features \
      --candidate-line-source bmeleton_merged \
      --max-pairs-for-refit 0 \
      --verbose

Important output:

    experimental_data/experimental_collected_features/
        static_candidate_features.csv

Additional diagnostic/candidate files are also written to this
directory.

The option

    --candidate-line-source bmeleton_merged

uses the BMeleton/Cloud_classes merged-line candidate construction. Raw
Hough line fragments are processed with the line-merging and
intersection procedure before candidate vertices and static features are
constructed.

The required supporting Python modules are included under:

    scripts/generate_vertex_candidates_from_hough.py
    scripts/Cloud_classes.py


