5. EXPERIMENTAL ALPHA-PARTICLE ENERGY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The derived alpha-energy table used by the center-of-mass analysis is:

    experimental_data/experimental_data_analysis/
        alpha_energy_reconstructed/alpha_kinetic_energy.csv

This file was reconstructed from the original Morgan-format detector
